 },
 "summary": "Eight single Schottky rectifiers in the DO-214AA (SMB) surface-mount body, all rated 8.0 A average forward current and 150 A surge, differing in reverse voltage from 20 V (SK82B) to 200 V (SK820B). Maximum forward voltage at 8 A rises with the voltage grade, from 0.45 V to 0.92 V. Named uses are low-voltage high-frequency inverters, freewheeling, DC/DC converters and polarity protection. SK810B is the 100 V grade.",
